[36m(TaskRunner pid=57070)[0m Your Task:  
[36m(TaskRunner pid=57070)[0m You dont need to read input or print anything. Complete the function sentencePalindrome() which takes a string s as input parameter and returns a boolean value denoting if sentence is a palindrome or not.
